<title>UK: Bank Leu sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Bank Leu sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Leu AG said it had issued three million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Novartis AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,675 CHF		 PREMIUM	11.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.10 CHF		  GEARING	13.1 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.FEB.97-15.JUL.98   PAYDATE	05.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,614 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
